  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "1. Have looping animation with smooth Physbone rotation built in 3.2.0\n\n2. Update to 3.2.1\n\n3. Animated Physbones no longer appear smoothly animated and instead seem to \"lock\" to positions.\n\nWhat my Animated Ears looks like in VRChat and 3.2.0:\n\nhttps://i.gyazo.com/601a6551fd5115f480093570ca26e2d7.mp4\n\nWhat they look like in Unity with 3.2.1 SDK: https://i.gyazo.com/559e442dfc6bb82fc98b034950cf6d84.mp4\n\nThey still move properly when uploaded to VRChat, this just makes it harder to test the animation curves of the animation without uploading first.",
